# Galian Beast (CR 712.14a, 400.7e): "When Galian Beast dies, return it to the battlefield tapped (front face up)." Bot2 bolts the Beast;
# in response to its trigger Bot1 sacrifices Tormod's Crypt to exile its own graveyard, Vincent Valentine in it. The card is no longer
# there as the trigger resolves, so nothing returns and no one's battlefield gains it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Vincent Valentine
Tormod's Crypt
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Vincent Valentine.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Tormod's Crypt.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Vincent Valentine > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Accept
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Galian Beast)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Tormod's Crypt.Activate(Bot1)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet
Bot1.Graveyard =
Exile = Vincent Valentine; Black Lotus; Tormod's Crypt
